    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of split limbs in this chaotic action-adventure where your head and body become instruments of mayhem. Harness magnetic powers to amplify your control while creating devastating attacks or clever diversions. Whether you're a precision head-shot specialist or a tactical mastermind, every challenge is an opportunity to express your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.poster.avif?t=1753645737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.webm?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.mp4?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Isn't Your Normal Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two points of control. Infinite possibilities. Star Head turns platforming into a symphony of coordinated chaos. Launch your head to clear paths while your body handles platforming challenges. Execute perfect teleports to reunite your split form at crucial moments. Chain magnetic powers between your two points to amplify your effectiveness. Create your own solutions - from aggressive dual-point attacks to cunning tactical separations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.poster.avif?t=1753645737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.webm?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.mp4?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Journey Beyond Logic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide QT, a head-launching android with a rebellious streak, through a world where reality bends in unexpected ways. From abandoned military bases to mysterious cities, you'll face corrupted machines, mutated creatures, and bizarre adversaries who'll push your abilities to their limits. Each environment challenges you to master your unique powers as you search for answers about QT's creator. The Star Head rocket holds secrets - if you can overcome the chaos that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of split limbs in this chaotic action-adventure where your head and body become instruments of mayhem. Harness magnetic powers to amplify your control while creating devastating attacks or clever diversions. Whether you're a precision head-shot specialist or a tactical mastermind, every challenge is an opportunity to express your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.poster.avif?t=1753645737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.webm?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/8ef3a4e4f6275023e52eefe7f2cb3bd9.mp4?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Isn't Your Normal Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two points of control. Infinite possibilities. Star Head turns platforming into a symphony of coordinated chaos. Launch your head to clear paths while your body handles platforming challenges. Execute perfect teleports to reunite your split form at crucial moments. Chain magnetic powers between your two points to amplify your effectiveness. Create your own solutions - from aggressive dual-point attacks to cunning tactical separations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.poster.avif?t=1753645737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.webm?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2097260/extras/2dc5dc66564a22ea129957dfc2ff90a6.mp4?t=1753645737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Journey Beyond Logic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide QT, a head-launching android with a rebellious streak, through a world where reality bends in unexpected ways. From abandoned military bases to mysterious cities, you'll face corrupted machines, mutated creatures, and bizarre adversaries who'll push your abilities to their limits. Each environment challenges you to master your unique powers as you search for answers about QT's creator. The Star Head rocket holds secrets - if you can overcome the chaos that stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
